.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-MEMORY-COMMIT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-memory\-commit \- Commit a versioned memory file change
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu memory commit\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-local\-authority\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIrequest.json\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Commit a versioned memory file change
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Explicit graph IRI for this operation
.TP
\fB\-\-local\-authority\fR
Explicitly authorize a local memory commit
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIrequest.json\fR>

